<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - Jan 16.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - Jan 16.</headline>
<text>
<p>DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST     MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   102/104   109/111     UNQ     207/210</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  107/109   113/116   220/222   232/236</p>
<p>-------- COMMENTS - Bunker levels on Thursday nosedived tracking weak cargo prices, traders said. A major said he sold a 2,000 tonne cargo of 380-cst at $107 per tonne. &quot;Plunging cargo prices have depressed bunker levels,&quot; said a trader. &quot;Levels will remained underpressure for a while,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3082)</p>
</text>
